# Coding standard

Read [`skills/coding-standard/SKILL.md`](../skills/coding-standard/SKILL.md) before editing Motoko.

- `mo:core` + contextual dot notation; no `mo:base`
- API → Service → Repository → Storage; ~300 lines max per file
- Service record + `create()` factory; validators pure `?Text`
- Stable storage not `transient`; fund paths use `caller`
- Avoid reserved field names: `label`, `type`, `query`, etc.
